          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Archive entry escapes the extraction directory\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example archive extractor writes a supplied entry name without checking containment, allowing a parent-directory entry to overwrite a file outside the extraction directory.\n\nSeverity: high\n\nCategory: Path traversal\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-22\n\nRemediation:\nResolve each entry destination and reject paths outside the extraction directory before writing.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Resolve each entry destination and reject paths outside the extraction directory before writing.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Resolve each entry destination and reject paths outside the extraction directory before writing."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:a3dc3a2d9135f6bf1c15867252d0d28f2b1341a569f5e84a1dc8a8fd808cd081"
