          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Sign-in callback accepts an external redirect\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example sign-in callback redirects to a supplied URL without checking its origin, allowing an attacker to send users from the sign-in flow to an unrelated site.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Open redirect\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-601\n\nRemediation:\nAccept only application-relative return paths or explicitly permitted origins.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Accept only application-relative return paths or explicitly permitted origins.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Accept only application-relative return paths or explicitly permitted origins."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
