          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Shell metacharacters in the export name execute commands\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example export route interpolates an untrusted filename into a shell command, allowing shell metacharacters to execute another command.\n\nSeverity: critical\n\nCategory: Command injection\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-78\n\nRemediation:\nPass the filename as a separate argument to a process API that does not invoke a shell.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Pass the filename as a separate argument to a process API that does not invoke a shell.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Pass the filename as a separate argument to a process API that does not invoke a shell."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:62fe3caecd4e65c4d5d1f032ca0dc52db1397399e2643e9322a72ab462c5bf75"
