          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Search term is concatenated into a SQL query\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example search handler concatenates request text into SQL, allowing a caller to change the query and read records beyond the intended search.\n\nSeverity: high\n\nCategory: SQL injection\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-89\n\nRemediation:\nUse a parameterized query for the search term.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Use a parameterized query for the search term.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Use a parameterized query for the search term."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
