          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Response header advertises the framework version\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example response header exposes the precise framework version. This helps fingerprint the service but does not establish an exploitable vulnerability.\n\nSeverity: informational\n\nCategory: Version disclosure\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-200\n\nRemediation:\nOmit the framework version from public response headers.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Omit the framework version from public response headers.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Omit the framework version from public response headers."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
