          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Session cookie omits HttpOnly\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example session cookie is accessible to browser scripts because HttpOnly is absent, increasing the impact of a separate script-injection vulnerability.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Cookie flags\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-1004\n\nRemediation:\nSet HttpOnly on the session cookie.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Set HttpOnly on the session cookie.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Set HttpOnly on the session cookie."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:3ea8f486f0c87f88034f4c56e1ef4baaf4bf48ee77b5dc411f22d24f4c024734"
