          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Error response exposes an internal stack trace\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example error handler returns a stack trace to a remote caller, revealing internal module names and filesystem layout.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Verbose errors\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-209\n\nRemediation:\nReturn a generic error identifier and retain diagnostic details in internal logs.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Return a generic error identifier and retain diagnostic details in internal logs.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Return a generic error identifier and retain diagnostic details in internal logs."
