          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Comment preview renders stored HTML\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example preview inserts a stored comment directly into HTML, allowing a comment author to execute script in another viewer's browser.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Stored XSS\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-79\n\nRemediation:\nRender comments as text or sanitize intentionally supported HTML before insertion.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Render comments as text or sanitize intentionally supported HTML before insertion.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Render comments as text or sanitize intentionally supported HTML before insertion."
