          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Image proxy fetches arbitrary destinations\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example image proxy fetches a caller-supplied URL without restricting its destination, allowing requests to internal services reachable by the proxy.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: SSRF\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-918\n\nRemediation:\nRestrict fetch destinations to the intended image hosts and enforce that policy across redirects.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Restrict fetch destinations to the intended image hosts and enforce that policy across redirects.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Restrict fetch destinations to the intended image hosts and enforce that policy across redirects."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
