          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "[Mock] Document download omits the ownership check\n\nSynthetic test finding. The example download handler accepts a document ID from any signed-in account and returns the document without checking that the account owns it.\n\nSeverity: high\n\nCategory: Missing authorization\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nRestrict document lookup to records the authenticated account is authorized to read.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- In the example application, verify the fix: Restrict document lookup to records the authenticated account is authorized to read.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Restrict document lookup to records the authenticated account is authorized to read."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
